YPE=Release` | Optimize for **performance** (adds `-O3`, strips debug info) |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr` | Where files will be installed (standard system location) |\n| `-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib` | Install libraries to `lib/` (not `lib64/`) |\n| `-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx` | Use **Intel C compiler** for C files |\n| `-DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=icpx` | Use **Intel"}